<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in quiet trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 33.83 to 6522.85.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.71 to 395.00.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.18.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1295 to 921.</p>
<p>Volume was 167,165,370, compared with 339,942,910 Monday.</p>
